# The program of protocols/generators.ir where a value may hold no layout or callee: every set that holds one is given up, so the untracked object arrives wherever a rule expects a built-in, a closure or a container.
# The solve ends with a result all the same, and the program with the results applied is valid
# OPTIONS: limit=MaxValueFlowSetMembers:0
# STATISTIC: MaxValueFlowSetMembersHits >= 1
# RUN: valueflow-solve
# CHECK-NOT: stopped at a limit
# CHECK: functions
# RUN(APPLY): valueflow-apply
# APPLY: function f0
# PROGRAM-OF: ../protocols/generators.ir
